{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1767595,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Vishwayouth 2026","festival_id":null,"organization_id":138430,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-08T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-21T22:01:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/vishwayouth-2026-nmims-navi-mumbai-1767595","region":"hybrid","details":"<p><strong>About Vishwayouth 2026:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Welcome to Vishwayouth 2026, an inter-college case competition designed to challenge participants across business acumen, analytical thinking, creativity, strategic decision-making, and communication.<\/li>\n<li>The competition takes participants through multiple stages, beginning with a quiz that tests business and logical aptitude, followed by an advertisement challenge in collaboration with Wobble, and a case-based problem-solving round. The shortlisted teams will then progress to the Grand Finale at NMIMS Navi Mumbai, where they will present and defend their final solutions before a judging panel.<\/li>\n<li>For the advertisement round, Wobble will provide participants with a problem statement\/advertising brief, based on which teams will have to conceptualise and create a short advertisement video. This round will test participants&rsquo; ability to translate a given business\/brand challenge into a creative, engaging, and effective advertisement.<\/li>\n<li>Vishwayouth 2026 is an opportunity to move beyond textbook concepts, tackle business challenges from multiple perspectives, and demonstrate your ability to analyse, strategise, communicate, and think on your feet.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Guidelines:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Each team must consist of 1 to 3 participants.<\/li>\n<li>Participants must follow the instructions provided for each round.<\/li>\n<li>All submissions must be made within the specified deadlines.<\/li>\n<li>All submissions must be original and created by the participating team.<\/li>\n<li>For Round 2, Wobble will provide the problem statement\/advertising brief,and teams must create an advertisement based on the given brief.<\/li>\n<li>The Round 2 advertisement must directly address the problem statement provided by Wobble.<\/li>\n<li>Shortlisted teams must be available for the subsequent rounds.<\/li>\n<li>Finalists must be available to attend the offline Grand Finale at NMIMS Navi Mumbai<\/li>\n<li>Participants must adhere to the prescribed format and submission guidelines for each round.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rules:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participants must adhere to all competition guidelines and deadlines.<\/li>\n<li>Plagiarism, copied work, or misrepresentation of submissions will result in disqualification.<\/li>\n<li>Late submissions may not be considered.<\/li>\n<li>The advertisement submitted for Round 2 must be an original creation of the participating team and must be based on the problem statement provided by Wobble.<\/li>\n<li>The organising committee reserves the right to disqualify teams violating the competition guidelines.<\/li>\n<li>The organising committee reserves the right to modify the competition schedule or format, if required.<\/li>\n<li>The decisions of the organising committee and judging panel shall be final and binding.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","overall_prizes":"Prizes worth \u20b92,50,000","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":25929981,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-08T08:30:24+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-08T10:51:18+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"case_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"M7aDL1r","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":30,"ch